{"3906790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flipper of Eridanus", "steam_appid": 3906790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipper of Eridanus combines fantasy level design with custom, realistic physics and a complete pinball tutorial to provide a new way to enjoy wonderful world of pinball and finally learn this classic pastime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/9dd0074ae14f6f4d81b372ffc8191a8d.webp?t=1775179011\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tYou are a bounty hunter, chasing strange bounties on alien worlds.  Finding your prey won't be easy and when you do, will you capture them, or put them to the ball?  Explore wondrous levels featuring classic pinball features, yet unbound by traditional boxed-in layouts.  Enjoy new mechanics especially designed for digital pinball.  Short on time?  Mini-games are also available to give you a quick pinball fix while you try for a new personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/8938463a244e76c8a9293c953909252b.webp?t=1775179011\" width=587 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever seen a pinball game out in public and want to play it, but decide not to because you don't know what you're doing and are afraid of wasting your money?  Fear no more.  Whether you are new to pinball or an experienced veteran, our pinball tutorials and practice table will help you to learn the game and improve your skills.  Once you have the basics down, test your pinball skills with advanced pinball physics  which accurately handles many classic pinball techniques.  Drop catches, post-passes, live catches, and flicks are all possible and work just like they would in a real pinball table!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/9a16674eb9e02486dbb50202cbcec629.webp?t=1775179011\" width=479 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, Flipper of Eridanus will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 fully featured tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 mini-tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full pinball tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable practice table</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flipper of Eridanus combines fantasy level design with custom, realistic physics and a complete pinball tutorial to provide a new way to enjoy wonderful world of pinball and finally learn this classic pastime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/9dd0074ae14f6f4d81b372ffc8191a8d.webp?t=1775179011\" width=600 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tYou are a bounty hunter, chasing strange bounties on alien worlds.  Finding your prey won't be easy and when you do, will you capture them, or put them to the ball?  Explore wondrous levels featuring classic pinball features, yet unbound by traditional boxed-in layouts.  Enjoy new mechanics especially designed for digital pinball.  Short on time?  Mini-games are also available to give you a quick pinball fix while you try for a new personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/8938463a244e76c8a9293c953909252b.webp?t=1775179011\" width=587 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever seen a pinball game out in public and want to play it, but decide not to because you don't know what you're doing and are afraid of wasting your money?  Fear no more.  Whether you are new to pinball or an experienced veteran, our pinball tutorials and practice table will help you to learn the game and improve your skills.  Once you have the basics down, test your pinball skills with advanced pinball physics  which accurately handles many classic pinball techniques.  Drop catches, post-passes, live catches, and flicks are all possible and work just like they would in a real pinball table!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/extras/9a16674eb9e02486dbb50202cbcec629.webp?t=1775179011\" width=479 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, Flipper of Eridanus will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 fully featured tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 mini-tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full pinball tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A customizable practice table</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A fantastical sci-fi pinball experience featuring advanced physics, unique table mechanics, mini-games, and a full pinball tutorial!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/b820c690cc2b179205eb47ebc100aad15f111ff4/header.jpg?t=1775179011", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/88677f8902a37b937836fd2a48bb63c9d144d295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775179011", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906790/88677f8902a37b937836fd2a48bb63c9d144d295/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775179011", "website": "https://fli